entries.english:
(Co-)Plaintiff / petitioner / intervenor: Bishop Johann Anton II of Eichstätt
(Co-)Defendant / intervenor: Elector Maximilian III Joseph of Bavaria; the chancellor and councillors of the Bavarian government at Amberg; Johann Karl Freiherr von Ilten, Bavarian chief magistrate at Neumarkt; and J(ohann Franz) B(enedikt) Freiherr Grießenbeck von Grießenbach, Bavarian chief magistrate at Sulzbürg
